T1  - Multicentric validation of proteomic biomarkers in urine specific for diabetic nephropathy.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0013421
A1  - Alkhalaf, Alaa
A1  - Zurbig, Petra
A1  - Bakker, Stephan J L
A1  - Bilo, Henk J G
A1  - Cerna, Marie
A1  - Fischer, Christine
A1  - Fuchs, Sebastian
A1  - Janssen, Bart
A1  - Medek, Karel
A1  - Mischak, Harald
