T1  - Independent components of chronic kidney disease as a cardiovascular risk state: results from the Kidney Early Evaluation Program (KEEP).
T3  - Comment in: Arch Intern Med. 2007 Jun 11;167(11):1113-5<ovid:br/> PMID: 17563017 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17563017]
