T1  - Multicenter evaluation of the Micral-Test II test strip, an immunologic rapid test for the detection of microalbuminuria.
T3  - Comment in: Diabetes Care. 1998 May;21(5):878-9<ovid:br/> PMID: 9589266 [https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/9589266]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2337/diacare.20.11.1642
A1  - Mogensen, C E
A1  - Viberti, G C
