UR  - http://bb2sz3ek3z.search.serialssolutions.com/?url_ver=Z39.88-2004&rft_val_fmt=info:ofi/fmt:kev:mtx:journal&rfr_id=info:sid/Ovid:med3&rft.genre=article&rft_id=info:doi/10.1136%2Fbmj.306.6894.1722&rft_id=info:pmid/8343628&rft.issn=0959-8138&rft.volume=306&rft.issue=6894&rft.spage=1722&rft.pages=1722-5&rft.date=1993&rft.jtitle=BMJ&rft.atitle=Is+screening+and+intervention+for+microalbuminuria+worthwhile+in+patients+with+insulin+dependent+diabetes%3F.&rft.aulast=Borch-Johnsen
ER  -
